# Project guard

BEFORE ANY CHANGE:

1. Read docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
2. Read docs/PROJECT_STATE.md.
3. Read the relevant requirement/specification.
4. Inspect the existing implementation.
5. Follow existing architecture.
6. Respect the current project phase/gate.
7. Do not perform unrelated work.
8. Do not proceed automatically to another step.

AFTER CHANGE:

1. Run relevant verification.
2. Report changed files.
3. STOP.

Architecture changes require explicit user approval.

The user must never need to say "read architecture first".
